  "title": "Boss Lift  for Employee Support of Guard and Reserve",
  "description": "An Employee Support of Guard and Reserve event was held at Grissom Air Reserve Base, Indiana on 22 and 23 August, 2024. Reservists from various reserve and guard units around the state of Indiana nominated their bosses to attend the event. On Thursday, nearly 40 employers from various companies participated in a base tour and had the opportunity to meet some of the troops that serve in the guard and reserve. They also were able to check out a variety of  exhibits put on display such as the KC-135 flight deck and boom pods, explosive ordnance disposal, services, fire rescue, chemical biological radiological nuclear and explosive response and more. On Friday the attendees participated in a familiarization flight aboard a KC-135 Stratotanker.",
